- added basic code exclusion (we dont want to remove
i
as a var, so we leave code intact) and key phrases exclusion "act as a" to "be", but then make sure "be" is protected so we don't remove it later. - got Gemini to write some test phrases.
- got Gemini to add a pretty UI and some basic "equivalant CO2 savings" at the bottom.
